Repair youtube_dl/utils.py. Unary boolean filters are wrong: a positive key must reject False, while !key must accept False and missing values. Replace the exact buggy block:
    UNARY_OPERATORS = {
        '': lambda v: v is not None,
        '!': lambda v: v is None,
    }

{"action":"replace","old":"    UNARY_OPERATORS = {
        '': lambda v: v is not None,
        '!': lambda v: v is None,
    }
","new":"    UNARY_OPERATORS = {
        '': lambda v: (v is True) if isinstance(v, bool) else (v is not None),
        '!': lambda v: (v is False) if isinstance(v, bool) else (v is None),
    }
"}
